WEBVTT

00:01:55.010 --> 00:01:58.260
And with this, all that's
left is to put in the final key.

00:01:58.260 --> 00:02:00.890
Yay! Praise me, praise me! Hey, come on...

00:02:00.890 --> 00:02:03.390
All right, then, we're going.

00:02:03.390 --> 00:02:07.640
What's this? Are you going
to bring the final Apostle here?

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:10.190
Those Magdalene bastards are an eyesore!

00:02:11.150 --> 00:02:13.900
So are the devils that
are helping the humans.

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:17.950
You guys can just play
with that as much as you'd like.

00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:19.950
Here we go... here we go...

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:26.370
I just hope they don't go berserk.

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:30.120
The time has come when all
those who would be Your servants,

00:02:30.120 --> 00:02:33.750
the prophets and the apostles,
the meek and the great,

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:37.590
all who fear Your name will be rewarded,

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:43.470
and those who would
destroy the Earth will be destroyed.

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:27.350
Your older sister is alive.

00:03:47.330 --> 00:03:49.370
I think it is almost ready.

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:50.370
Okay.

00:03:59.090 --> 00:04:02.300
Miraculously, this alone survived.

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:03.300
What?

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:08.390
That cup?

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:15.400
Yes, the whole of the mansion had
been torn apart, and amongst that...

00:04:22.780 --> 00:04:24.610
I am powerless.

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:27.030
I don't even possess
the kind of power you do.

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:32.540
But you stayed by her side.

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:39.500
There are times when you can help
someone just by being near them.

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:46.090
I'm sure that, to Satella,
you were her greatest support.

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:49.930
Maybe that was a little preachy.

00:04:57.770 --> 00:04:59.730
The situation is changing.

00:05:01.400 --> 00:05:03.610
It appears that the San Francisco branch

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:07.570
has also begun to take serious
action using their own discretion.

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:14.210
Could the Sinner Aion
destroying the Jewel Witch's family

00:05:14.210 --> 00:05:17.250
also have had
something to do with this case?

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:22.840
It appears that we're always
one step behind, doesn't it?

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:26.880
This time, we cannot
allow them to do as they wish.

00:05:26.880 --> 00:05:31.060
That is why we've allied
ourselves with devils after all.

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:38.440
All of the causality
is gathering in San Francisco.

00:05:38.440 --> 00:05:40.520
It appears that
the West Coast's Astral Line

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:43.190
has started to show
the effects of that as well.

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:45.190
I've heard as much from Elder.

00:05:46.070 --> 00:05:48.740
Dispatching scout planes
is currently under consideration.

00:05:50.120 --> 00:05:53.040
Without the permission of the council?

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:55.620
The higher ups won't stay quiet.

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:57.960
I will pretend that I can't hear them.

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:07.930
I wonder if the Lord
will smile upon their future?

00:06:15.310 --> 00:06:17.310
How are you feeling?

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:30.990
Let's freshen up the air in here.
I'm opening the doors!

00:06:38.960 --> 00:06:42.960
The weather's nice. How about
going outside for a change of scenery?

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:51.090
You're always cheerful, aren't you?

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:53.390
Satella...

00:07:00.310 --> 00:07:01.310
This...

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:11.160
The brilliance won't
come back to it, just like me.

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:22.880
Rosette!

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:24.630
Rosette! What's wrong?

00:07:24.630 --> 00:07:26.800
Nothing,I'm telling you.

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:31.760
I'm all right. I'm an idiot, you know?

00:07:31.760 --> 00:07:35.350
I hit my head there
just now. So don't worry.

00:07:35.930 --> 00:07:38.430
You can't tell us not to worry!

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:41.230
Please let me see for a moment!

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:43.400
I'm telling you, it's not anything serious!

00:08:04.250 --> 00:08:05.420
Why?

00:08:07.420 --> 00:08:10.510
I'll go get some bandages and antiseptic.

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:28.020
I've finished wrapping the bandages,

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:31.280
but the blood just isn't stopping.

00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:34.030
It's all right. I said it's nothing big.

00:08:35.860 --> 00:08:38.160
You know, don't you?

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:44.080
What are they?

00:08:46.210 --> 00:08:50.380
Stigmata...

00:08:51.340 --> 00:08:56.680
They appear in the same places where
Jesus Christ's body was cut and wounded.

00:08:56.680 --> 00:08:58.010
They're the markings of God.

00:08:59.180 --> 00:09:01.850
They're proof that she's
been chosen to be God's own.

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:11.570
Lady Rosette, there's a call
for you from the Magdalene Order.

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:24.540
A devil's failure will be settled...

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:27.370
...by a devil.

00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:32.710
Duffau and the others will be
in charge of storming the hideout.

00:09:32.710 --> 00:09:35.630
Rosette and Chrono will join up with them.

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:37.430
We will provide backup.

00:09:37.430 --> 00:09:40.890
We'll utilize crucifix barriers
and seal away the Sinners.

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:45.770
We cannot let them escape
to the city, no matter the cost.

00:09:45.770 --> 00:09:49.150
One hundred and twenty <i>Principatus</i>
crucifix barriers have been set up.

00:09:49.150 --> 00:09:50.940
Forty Powers have been set up.

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:55.530
Set up for three Sacred
machine guns will be finished soon!

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:01.830
It looks like they've
located the Sinners' hideout!

00:10:01.830 --> 00:10:03.410
It's on a beach on the outskirts of 'Cisco.

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:05.200
There's going to be
a coordinated attack at noon!

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:07.460
Azmaria, take care of Satella.

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:08.540
What?

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:13.590
What do you mean by that?
I'm going to fight alongside you!

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:16.970
Right now,
it's impossible for you to fight devils!

00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:19.760
You should know that
better than anyone else!

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:28.350
Stay here for today.
We'll do your share of the fighting too, so...

00:10:31.100 --> 00:10:32.940
I'm all right,I'm all right!

00:10:32.940 --> 00:10:36.150
I feel a lot better since I was treated.

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:37.280
And besides...

00:10:38.450 --> 00:10:41.490
...I've got this present
from Elder, so it'll be fine.

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:43.030
Right?

00:10:43.030 --> 00:10:45.240
Now then! There's no time to lose!

00:10:45.240 --> 00:10:47.080
Time isn't going to stop for us after all!

00:10:47.080 --> 00:10:51.170
Azmaria, take care of Satella!
This is important work too.

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:52.790
Right.

00:10:52.790 --> 00:10:53.920
We're going, Chrono!

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:54.960
R-Right!

00:10:54.960 --> 00:10:56.050
Rosette!

00:11:01.430 --> 00:11:02.800
Be careful.

00:11:37.170 --> 00:11:39.130
There isn't anyone here!

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:41.630
So they got away.

00:12:01.280 --> 00:12:05.280
Your actions are obvious!

00:12:41.740 --> 00:12:43.070
Everyone!

00:12:43.070 --> 00:12:44.610
Rosette!

00:12:44.610 --> 00:12:45.360
Are you all right?

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:46.240
Yes.

00:12:46.240 --> 00:12:48.410
Leave it to us!

00:12:49.120 --> 00:12:50.620
Reinforcements, huh?

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:54.330
Duffau!

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:58.420
Sinner Viede, Sinner Genai...

00:12:58.420 --> 00:13:02.800
By Pandemonium's will,
both of you will be punished!

00:13:05.180 --> 00:13:06.840
You bastard!

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:10.810
Listen to what I'm saying, boy!

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:35.460
They got us.
At this rate, all we are is a liability.

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:38.000
What are you saying? It's not over yet!

00:13:41.420 --> 00:13:42.550
You're right.

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:46.090
Evacuate the wounded!

00:13:46.090 --> 00:13:49.300
Anyone who can keep fighting,
back up Duffau and the others!

00:13:49.300 --> 00:13:50.350
Yes, Sir!

00:13:53.930 --> 00:13:55.100
Rosette!

00:13:56.770 --> 00:13:57.810
You mustn't!

00:13:57.810 --> 00:13:58.770
But!

00:13:59.690 --> 00:14:03.150
I don't want to reduce
your life span any more!

00:14:04.030 --> 00:14:05.030
Chrono...

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:06.860
You traitor!

00:14:28.720 --> 00:14:30.970
Use that,Chrono!

00:14:30.970 --> 00:14:33.010
Don't you dare look away!

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:37.230
Chrono!
Before you wave that toy around,

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:39.560
hurry up and go back to your original form!

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:41.900
We can't let the power
that killed one hundred million

00:14:41.900 --> 00:14:44.360
go berserk in this place!

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:45.820
You coward!

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:47.650
You bastard!

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:13.010
All of this crap is annoying!

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:32.200
Cut me a break on how
many times I have to do this.

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:34.620
Even slowpokes have their limits!

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:38.870
Thank you, Mr. Carv.

00:15:42.830 --> 00:15:44.130
There are a lot of injured.

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:45.920
It would be best to
fall back for the time being.

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:48.590
So it seems.

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:52.300
Anyone that's free,
while you protect the injured,

00:15:52.300 --> 00:15:53.970
we're going to temporarily
fall back to the rear position!

00:15:53.970 --> 00:15:54.850
Yes, Sir!

00:15:54.850 --> 00:15:56.970
Rosette, be careful!

00:15:56.970 --> 00:15:59.310
I'll be all right! Leave the rest to me!

00:15:59.310 --> 00:16:01.140
Come back with Chrono, okay?

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:03.480
That's an absolute promise, okay?

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:04.440
Yeah...

00:16:18.990 --> 00:16:22.160
What's wrong? Is this all
you've got, killer of one hundred million?

00:16:22.160 --> 00:16:23.120
Chrono!

00:16:34.630 --> 00:16:36.680
So this is the bullet that killed Rizel.

00:16:38.260 --> 00:16:39.390
This is tiresome!

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:56.320
Using devils to get the better of devils...

00:16:56.320 --> 00:16:59.780
Was our choice truly the correct one?

00:16:59.780 --> 00:17:01.910
Minister Gilliam!

00:17:01.910 --> 00:17:04.830
The set up for the Dominions
wide-area barrier is complete.

00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:06.500
All right!

00:17:07.210 --> 00:17:09.000
Activate the wide-area barrier!

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:16.930
There! How long can you hold out?

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:18.720
Stop your babbling!

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:20.180
This is the end!

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:24.770
Genai!

00:17:26.100 --> 00:17:29.110
Damn it! Now you've gone and done it!

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:35.450
Chrono!

00:17:35.450 --> 00:17:36.910
Duffau!

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:49.040
So it's begun.

00:17:52.170 --> 00:17:54.300
Now, Rosette!

00:18:03.890 --> 00:18:05.930
Die!

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:17.570
Man, there's just no end when
it comes to taking care of humans,

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:19.240
right,Chrono?

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:32.130
I'm taking you with me!

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:39.760
Carv!

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:41.470
Viede!

00:18:52.440 --> 00:18:57.490
I won't forgive you.
I won't forgive you, you bastards!

00:19:09.210 --> 00:19:11.960
Damn it! Damn it!

00:19:13.290 --> 00:19:18.130
Viede died,
right before my eyes. Son of a bitch!

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:23.720
Whoa, you were
soundly beaten, weren't you?

00:19:23.720 --> 00:19:26.010
That's why it would have been
best for you to not have gone.

00:19:26.010 --> 00:19:29.980
Well, your auto-regenerative abilities
will be able to handle injuries like that.

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:31.310
Shut up!

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:33.270
What about Chrono?

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:35.570
He was an utter wimp.

00:19:36.820 --> 00:19:40.280
I don't know if it was because
that girl was hurt or something,

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:43.320
but he pulled some crap like
trying to fight in his tiny form.

00:19:44.700 --> 00:19:45.660
Hurt?

00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:50.120
I see...

00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:54.880
That means He's finally
decided to advance his pawns.

00:19:56.960 --> 00:19:59.210
Joshua! I have good news!

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:03.130
Lord Aion...

00:20:06.680 --> 00:20:07.720
What's wrong?

00:20:15.730 --> 00:20:17.360
Big sister...

00:20:19.190 --> 00:20:20.780
...big sister, where are you?

00:20:22.030 --> 00:20:24.990
Lord Joshua, I am here.

00:20:25.820 --> 00:20:28.830
My big sister... Where's my big sister?

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:35.080
Joshua, your beloved sister
will be coming to see you soon.

00:20:37.210 --> 00:20:39.090
My big sister is?

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:42.420
That's right, isn't that nice?

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:43.550
Big sister...

00:20:46.850 --> 00:20:49.180
Yeah, I'm looking forward to it.

00:20:53.810 --> 00:20:58.020
Let's light the candles and raise a toast.

00:20:58.020 --> 00:20:59.770
Let's give her a warm welcome.

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:04.200
Tomorrow's the carnival.
It's going to be fun!
